        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7501/51, 2 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Round Sliding Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Round Brushed Stainless Steel Flush Pull has a 2 inch diameter. The 2 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Round Sliding Door Pull is usually used on sliding pocket doors. It has a brushed stainless steel finish. The 2 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Round Sliding Door Pull is mortised into the face of the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/2-9-16-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-flush-pull-omnia-7500-65\"><b>2-9/16 inch Round Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/1-3-8-round-brushed-stainless-steel-flush-pull-omnia-7502-35\"><b>1-3/8 Inch Round Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 7501 Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Hole Cut Out: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 Inch Round Brushed Stainless Steel Flush Pull, Omnia 7501/51",
                "description": "2 Inch Stainless Steel Round Flush Pull, Omnia 7501/51 - The Medium Round Brushed Stainless Steel Flush Pull has a 2 inch diameter. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door. For use on sliding doors, pocket doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush pull is desired. A low profile design allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. It features a lip for fingers to catch on to for easy use.",
